          "description": "Senior Full Stack Engineer (Java/Spring Boot & Angular)\nWe're looking for an experienced Senior Full Stack Engineer to join our dynamic engineering team and contribute to the development of scalable, secure, and high-performing applications.\nThe ideal candidate brings strong expertise in Java, Spring Boot, Angular, and modern cloud technologies, along with the ability to lead technical initiatives and mentor fellow engineers.\nKey Responsibilities\nDesign, develop, and maintain full-stack applications using Java, Spring Boot, Angular, and TypeScript.\nBuild scalable microservices and RESTful APIs.\nDevelop responsive, high-quality user interfaces.\nContribute to system architecture, performance optimization, and security best practices.\nMentor engineers, conduct code reviews, and collaborate with cross-functional Agile teams.\nSupport cloud-based deployments and production systems.\nRequired Skills & Experience\n5+ years of professional software development experience.\nStrong proficiency in Java, Spring Boot, Angular, and TypeScript.\nExperience with AWS, Docker, and Kubernetes.\nStrong understanding of microservices architecture, RESTful APIs, SQL, and relational databases.\nWorking knowledge of Terraform and CI/CD practices.\nPrior experience working with Transportation Management Systems (TMS) is a plus.\nExperience with unit testing, secure coding, and Agile/Scrum methodologies.\nStrong problem-solving, communication, and technical leadership skills.\nJob Details\n📍 Location: Remote\n💼 Employment: Full-Time\n🎯 Experience: 5+ Years",
